Convert this Python function to Go. It needs to behave identically:

def running_stats(nums):
    if not nums:
        return {"mean": 0.0, "max": None, "count": 0}
    total = 0
    mx = nums[0]
    for n in nums:
        total += n
        if n > mx:
            mx = n
    return {"mean": total / len(nums), "max": mx, "count": len(nums)}

